 "set": "ip-label-filter",
 "description": "ip() label filters (PR for semantics/ip-label-filter-missing-label): Loki drops a line without the label under = and !=, keeps a whole address in the pattern under = and the others under !=. IP1 is the run's case (payment-service lines have no addr: Loki no line; before, a single address was sent as a match-all regexp, 99 lines). IP2-IP5 read the generator's ip key (10.0-5.x.y) on api-gateway and auth-service: a CIDR under = and !=, a CIDR and a range under count_over_time. The filter is an ipv4_range on the label with guards for what VictoriaLogs' parser reads and Loki's does not. Run with the control set.",
